cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. The accompanying paper is in preparation (no DOI yet)."
title: "RESONATE"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/J041120h/RESONATE"
url: "https://j041120h.github.io/RESONATE_tutorial/"
abstract: >-
  RESONATE (REconstructing Spatial Omics via Neighborhood, Atlas Transfer and Embeddings) predicts genes that a
  spatial transcriptomics panel did not measure, by combining expression in similar cells of a matched single-cell
  reference, the gene's relationships with measured genes and information from spatial neighbors, with every gene
  represented by its foundation-model embedding.
keywords:
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - gene imputation
  - single-cell reference
  - foundation models
